@baseUrl = http://localhost:3333

### Login na API
# @name login

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "ssuper@mail.com",
  "password": "supersuper"
}


### Listar tarefas

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}


### Buscar tarefa

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}


### Criar tarefa

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "title": "Teste com access token",
  "description": "Agora o REST Client pega o token automaticamente",
  "type": "general"
}


### Atualizar tarefa

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "title": "Tarefa atualizada"
}


### Alterar status

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "status": "in_progress"
}


### Excluir tarefa

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}